// expect: refuse E_TypeMismatch
// `Option` takes one type argument and the annotation hands it two, the arity
// face of a type mismatch. Every error refuses the executable. Until
// 2026-10-16 this face reported and the program compiled anyway: on boot
// 969f2559 it answered 3, the annotation dropped.
fn f(x: Option(Int, Int)) = 3

fn main() = f(None)
